  },
  "researchBrief": "The story about Hint, the AI home management app co-founded by Martha Stewart, was corroborated across multiple sources. Key details include the app's features, such as personalized maintenance schedules, document tracking, and insurance advice. The app is currently available for free on iOS and aims to simplify home management tasks. Martha Stewart is actively involved in the development and is not just a figurehead. The app was initially focused on decarbonization incentives but pivoted to a broader scope. The startup has secured $10 million in funding from various investors. All claims are supported by the provided sources.",
